From: Amphion <amphion@AmphiondeMacBook-Air.local>
Date: Wed, 10 Jun 2026 17:11:35 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] feat(jni): vendor WeTextProcessing and add WetextItn JNI
 bindings

Restore amphion-wetext ITN runtime on top of text-rewrite-fst: vendor
WeTextProcessing C++ processor under csrc/wetext/, wire into
sherpa-onnx-core, and expose Java_com_k2fsa_sherpa_onnx_WetextItn_* JNI.

Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>
